      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "What is $(\\sqrt{64})^{2}?$",
      "worked_solution": "The number in the square root is non-negative, so the square and the square root cancel each other out.\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n(\\sqrt{64})^{2}=64.\n$$",
