      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "What is $\\sqrt{{(-36)}^{2}}?$",
      "worked_solution": "Remember that by definition, the square root is always zero or positive, never negative.\n\nSo, the square root comes out to\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{(-36)^{2}}=\\sqrt{{36}^{2}}=36.\n$$",
